sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS has implemented device model monitoring<br>and MonitoringCtrlr.Enabled = true

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Instruct CSMS to set a monitoring base of All

    CSMS->>CS: SetMonitoringBaseRequest (monitoringBase = All)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 1): SetMonitoringBaseRequest<br>monitoringBase = All
    CS-->>CSMS: SetMonitoringBaseResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Instruct CSMS to set a monitoring base of FactoryDefault

    CS->>CSMS: SetMonitoringBaseRequest (monitoringBase = FactoryDefault)
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 3): SetMonitoringBaseRequest<br>monitoringBase = FactoryDefault
    CS-->>CSMS: SetMonitoringBaseResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: Instruct CSMS to set a monitoring base of HardWiredOnly

    CS->>CSMS: SetMonitoringBaseRequest (monitoringBase = HardWiredOnly)
    CS-->>CSMS: SetMonitoringBaseResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation (Step 6): SetMonitoringBaseRequest<br>monitoringBase = HardWiredOnly
